Subject: Re: Common date scale with year as aesthetic
Message-ID: <qvkV6gAKubg.Fw1Qcs12BAAJ@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <qvkV6gAKubg.wYwjT9lVBAAJ@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
References: <qvkV6gAKubg.wYwjT9lVBAAJ@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
