Subject: Re: geom_line plots bars?
Message-ID: <gayAU4bEXPk.oDTZFN2MCwAJ@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <gayAU4bEXPk.o8nwDIyCCwAJ@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
